            <div xml:id="m-9f7b942d-813f-422f-9e24-ea53def53f25">
              <lg xml:id="m-1a42dee3-a9f4-4d95-9e9f-4b5981c8038a">
                <l xml:id="m-8d2e63a0-a47b-400c-a6ae-327ac0fce248" facs="#m-6e1167aa-f52e-40a7-9abc-94d88bd3678b" label="text-like">Common of a Confessor Bishop. At Sext.</l><l xml:id="m-0d1f099c-4605-4a56-8793-d36cd69270ca" facs="#m-3a9a5fb1-2c94-46ab-9780-cc462bb5e9dd" label="ambiguous">n174</l><l xml:id="m-86088bb8-d54f-4829-8385-502bc2c6d423" facs="#m-cfcf806c-8cdf-4199-8fc5-21745328ea82" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. Ecce sacérdos mágnus p. 1176. Psalms as on Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-5e99b5ab-2f13-4c8e-b1e3-11aad91be05f" facs="#m-e1932d51-cc73-4721-a5bf-634f45dc5275" label="lyrics-like">Short Lesson. Fungi sacerdótio. p. 1175.</l><l xml:id="m-119b8956-1753-4c45-8a15-288b92347d80" facs="#m-f228d447-56a2-426e-b61e-03c1758ca8ca" label="text-like">AT TERCE.</l><l xml:id="m-85c7fa9c-338a-4238-8f2e-f8b419add229" facs="#m-28f40331-087b-4e7f-b905-e66e248337ed" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Non est invéntus. D. 1176. Psaims of Sunday. Chapter of</l><l xml:id="m-69988f12-89fa-48ad-ac7c-6ac45022c1ce" facs="#m-dba2f751-8e96-41a1-8386-3d8c0cac4ad7" label="lyrics-like">Vespers. Ecce sacérdos magnus. » 77.</l><l xml:id="m-a9041017-df09-4c04-a535-2e56707dbd21" facs="#m-226de2e5-16e2-447d-a4ee-8bc11edc0c48" label="ambiguous">Short!</l><l xml:id="m-cb8def93-ec82-4927-a944-e69444b6e5f6" facs="#m-624ed55a-bc1e-4f4c-b9a3-5b357bb7c2b0" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-5f765dec-8d0c-40f9-aa9b-465c6dea2941" facs="#m-35362d5a-58f5-4229-8143-880e48550d0c" label="lyrics-like">-mávit é-um Dómi-nus, " Et orná- vit é- um.</l><l xml:id="m-1d3292b1-3615-4e75-98da-6cc486c3a57b" facs="#m-aad703ae-e396-43cd-bada-448752c82d9e" label="lyrics-like">V. Stó-lam gló-ri-ae indu-it é-um. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et</l><l xml:id="m-f4ed02be-c373-49a1-a4f7-fdc1b99eaabf" facs="#m-fbb2baab-45ad-4109-bfe4-dca8ca98a621" label="lyrics-like">Fí-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-8a946d11-9550-45fe-a99c-6dfd94a737b5" facs="#m-98464175-4ab1-494a-86ad-595f4ede72bd" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-8f02b689-5cd9-4f32-8b13-1e675b0fcd88" facs="#m-0380ec8c-9419-40a5-9ec0-af349c401eba" label="ambiguous">short!</l><l xml:id="m-39aeb20f-a33f-4195-9a2a-0cf8eba7a865" facs="#m-83c3895b-a314-4384-bdf6-b8b81e0ba90a" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-b50319a8-8446-481d-808d-8553f65ff051" facs="#m-6b5d5d61-6503-48a2-9eef-ce1c036a162e" label="lyrics-like">-mávit é-um Dóminus, et ornávit é-um:“Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-784c6730-ebea-4902-9faa-ad0fde978c80" facs="#m-4f3bcd28-831b-4a80-8baf-59662f607f9a" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia, alle-lú-ia. V. Stó-lam gló-ri-ae indu-it é-um. Gló¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9348d81-1dc7-464e-b64b-2163b4683c00" facs="#m-d15f2a90-b067-4356-928f-b3f9f00b69dd" label="lyrics-like">ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-6b3f7d22-73d7-41d3-9c87-de64719da8b7" facs="#m-7bbc3480-1b7e-4876-b079-7e46f1c68d04" label="lyrics-like">v. Elégit éum Dóminus sacerdótem sibi (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-a412aba7-4ad6-452f-8238-499d1cfc0672" facs="#m-5c907c08-eaca-4237-a47f-3a2469299eae" label="lyrics-like">H. Ad sacrificándum éi hóstiam láudis. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-b80b74ee-362d-416d-a3d0-4bb445fb59f3" facs="#m-f926fbd9-3062-4cdc-bc64-42248ba28787" label="text-like">The Masses are found after and Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-4e4b8518-edc0-4174-b2e8-e72ad5f7a601" facs="#m-797ee816-5987-453a-a19a-639b2739281a" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-72d8289c-ac36-4cb4-8d5b-ca50604c9889" facs="#m-ec086d42-b0ca-45d2-a64a-364f372a93be" label="text-like">Ant. Ideo. p. 1176. Psalms of Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-877fe516-b17a-4c0b-9cfe-beb8d64d699e" facs="#m-8ccb787f-2785-469d-b020-46f3679afe16" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-13f8e4e8-6f21-446b-8b6a-4c4843bbfd77" facs="#m-cb97c0d8-a172-425f-8213-85bb31ea7732" label="ambiguous">Eccli. 44. c.</l><l xml:id="m-95be698f-4bee-46bc-bc89-d5c2af040847" facs="#m-495a7459-db48-4015-bf68-97e9e476797e" label="lyrics-like">ON est invéntus similis illi, si:* ideo jurejurándo fecit illum</l><l xml:id="m-f281f11d-2d3d-4177-aee8-059ca1274c3b" facs="#m-d104bdaf-0e6f-48e2-9985-7d62c3cb8d1d" label="lyrics-like">1t qui conserváret legem Excé-Dóminus créscere in plebem suam.</l><l xml:id="m-3ed58293-e8d8-4550-b492-5e81cbfa63d2" facs="#m-cb31becc-907f-4130-85d9-e9ec20d5409b" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-7818c57c-3e47-4b4a-9502-f3662859a0fb" facs="#m-5caa2cee-ee6f-42f7-afe7-479a0a6f33ca" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-b99bc620-fdb4-4b93-b7da-bfd35723f544" facs="#m-68eb4918-fc99-48df-8ba3-74078c22d746" label="lyrics-like">-légit é-um Dómi-nus “Sacerdó-tem sí-bi. V. Ad</l><l xml:id="m-1b0e220d-089c-4286-8237-2b4bdf68b07e" facs="#m-d112b625-8aa0-4e88-be6b-33b583809091" label="ambiguous">A</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>